    <string name="engine_summary_body">1. Reset Guard: resetAutoBrightness() &amp; (int) + resetAmbientAdapter\n2. Anti-Drift &amp; Debounce: OplusBrightnessAmbientAdapter + StabilityProcess\n3. Night Floor (8.5 nit) + DarkEnv &amp; ReduceBrightness bypass + AuxLux balancer</string>
